{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because the delivery of the Eurofima series passenger coaches was initially delayed, Austrian state operator OBB made an order of similar coaches manufactured at &quot;Simmering-Graz-Pauker&quot; works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These were fitted with SGP-VS-RIC bogey capable of international traffic of up to 160km/h and were delivered between 1976-1978 equipped with folding doors and 1980-1982 with sliding doors. In the late '80s they were upgraded to reach a maximum speed of 200km/h and after 2003 through OBBs &quot;Upgrading-Program&quot; there were completely modernised, receiving a new interior, HVAC, power sockets, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pack includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*1 realistic coach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*1 detailed interior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Full PBR textures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Static source sound</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*3 different kinds of train-end signs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Brakeshoe option (does not affect the braking sequence, only for visual effect)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Animated couplers &amp; air hoses and sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*3 levels of buffer contact sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Train brake sound</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Up to 5 levels of LOD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Doors that open/close via Properties tab or when loading/unloading passengers plus sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Disable Physics option</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Custom bogeysounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Interior &amp; exterior nightmode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Editable destination boards with text fields for departure station, destination station, via station, train number</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658750?t=1745476625","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3658750?t=1745476625","capsule_image